{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06053","headline":"故太子太师徐公挽歌四首 三 · 王维","name":"故太子太师徐公挽歌四首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧里趋庭日，新年置酒辰。\n闻诗鸾渚客，献赋凤楼人。\n北首辞明主，东堂哭大臣。\n犹思御朱辂，不惜[污]车茵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06053.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06053","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}